Package: mediavault
Version: 1.0.2
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-venv, python3-pip, nginx
Maintainer: MediaVault <mediavault@local>
Homepage: https://gitee.com
Description: Self-hosted media server (Jellyfin-like)
 MediaVault is a self-hosted media platform with NFO scanning,
 user accounts, poster wall, and web playback.
 Installed to /opt/mediavault. Data lives in /var/lib/mediavault.
 Remove with: apt remove mediavault
 Purge data with: apt purge mediavault
